(7218622, 1113026, 117534, '<td valign="top">You do understand how babies are made. Right? Freaking masterpiece!</td>', 'You do understand how babies are made. Right? Freaking masterpiece!', '2014-05-20 01:44:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(7219051, 1112941, 21671, '<td valign="top">Very sharp</td>', 'Very sharp', '2014-05-21 09:02:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(7219459, 1113049, 150277, '<td valign="top">Just amazing.  Superb lighting and colors.</td>', 'Just amazing.  Superb lighting and colors.', '2014-05-21 21:35:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7219461, 1112941, 150277, '<td valign="top">Nice sharpness.  He almost looks like he is posing for you, waiting to fly off until you got your shot.</td>', 'Nice sharpness.  He almost looks like he is posing for you, waiting to fly off until you got your shot.', '2014-05-21 21:36:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7219464, 1113048, 150277, '<td valign="top">Interesting and dark piece.  I like the sharpening of the hand up to the fingers.  (I find the fly disturbing, but this is a well done image.)</td>', 'Interesting and dark piece.  I like the sharpening of the hand up to the fingers.  (I find the fly disturbing, but this is a well done image.)', '2014-05-21 21:38:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(7219466, 1112978, 150277, '<td valign="top">Cool.  I love this presentation with one sharp wing.   Makes me so curious.</td>', 'Cool.  I love this presentation with one sharp wing.   Makes me so curious.', '2014-05-21 21:39:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(7219468, 1113044, 150277, '<td valign="top">Beautiful monochrome.</td>', 'Beautiful monochrome.', '2014-05-21 21:43:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(7219470, 1113069, 150277, '<td valign="top">Very creative.  Lovely colors. I hope you share how you captured this.</td>', 'Very creative.  Lovely colors. I hope you share how you captured this.', '2014-05-21 21:49:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(7219471, 1112903, 150277, '<td valign="top">Wonderful. So sharp.</td>', 'Wonderful. So sharp.', '2014-05-21 21:54:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(7219472, 1113005, 150277, '<td valign="top">I love the wings.</td>', 'I love the wings.', '2014-05-21 21:55:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(7219613, 1112902, 173844, '<td valign="top">Great magical feel to this ethereal image.  I love how the fireflies seem to be the animate spirits of the white flowers.  The mythical ethos is furthered by the woman/goddess releasing the fireflies from a jar.  Why were they in a jar in the first place?  Just curious.  Also, personally, I don''t understand the forward purple on the tree.  These are minor quibbles.  This is far and away my favorite in the challenge.</td>', 'Great magical feel to this ethereal image.  I love how the fireflies seem to be the animate spirits of the white flowers.  The mythical ethos is furthered by the woman/goddess releasing the fireflies from a jar.  Why were they in a jar in the first place?  Just curious.  Also, personally, I don''t understand the forward purple on the tree.  These are minor quibbles.  This is far and away my favorite in the challenge.', '2014-05-22 11:16:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(7219622, 1113026, 173844, '<td valign="top">Terrific dramatic choreography.  The pose combining two people into a single bird is inventive and creatively brought to fruition.  The hands as talons is a wonderful touch.  The background is appropriately moody.  The branch as foreground is a curious choice, in my opinion.  But this is a fine black and white image.</td>', 'Terrific dramatic choreography.  The pose combining two people into a single bird is inventive and creatively brought to fruition.  The hands as talons is a wonderful touch.  The background is appropriately moody.  The branch as foreground is a curious choice, in my opinion.  But this is a fine black and white image.', '2014-05-22 11:34:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(7219631, 1112938, 173844, '<td valign="top">Although I generally don''t like partially desaturated images, this is beautiful and moving.  The coloration is like an old tinted photo, and it seems to glow.  The purple hue of the foreground perfectly harmonizes with girl''s purple shirt.  Altogether lovely.</td>', 'Although I generally don''t like partially desaturated images, this is beautiful and moving.  The coloration is like an old tinted photo, and it seems to glow.  The purple hue of the foreground perfectly harmonizes with girl''s purple shirt.  Altogether lovely.', '2014-05-22 11:50:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(7219633, 1113083, 173844, '<td valign="top">Adorable capture and great title.  Their awkward innocence makes me smile.  Nice detail and bokeh.  Really enjoyable.</td>', 'Adorable capture and great title.  Their awkward innocence makes me smile.  Nice detail and bokeh.  Really enjoyable.', '2014-05-22 11:55:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(7220013, 1112978, 173844, '<td valign="top">The little bit of focus on the wing nicely sets off the rest of the fly, elegantly composed and disappearing into the background.  I like how the fly fills the frame and especially like the faint shadows.</td>', 'The little bit of focus on the wing nicely sets off the rest of the fly, elegantly composed and disappearing into the background.  I like how the fly fills the frame and especially like the faint shadows.', '2014-05-23 12:23:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(7220014, 1113081, 173844, '<td valign="top">Excellent evocation of the essence of flight. And that''s quite an eye.</td>', 'Excellent evocation of the essence of flight. And that''s quite an eye.', '2014-05-23 12:25:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(7220016, 1112903, 173844, '<td valign="top">Nice detail here, with a fine look at the farther pair of wings.  The complicated world, hinted at in the background bokeh, fades away to yield this timeless moment.</td>', 'Nice detail here, with a fine look at the farther pair of wings.  The complicated world, hinted at in the background bokeh, fades away to yield this timeless moment.', '2014-05-23 12:32:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(7220017, 1113044, 173844, '<td valign="top">Intriguing take on the challenge that works for me.  Mesmerizing symmetry.</td>', 'Intriguing take on the challenge that works for me.  Mesmerizing symmetry.', '2014-05-23 12:35:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(7220018, 1112980, 173844, '<td valign="top">Wow, never saw anything like this!  Engaging and perfectly captured.  Great focus.</td>', 'Wow, never saw anything like this!  Engaging and perfectly captured.  Great focus.', '2014-05-23 12:41:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(7220019, 1113048, 173844, '<td valign="top">Mysterious and tender.  There''s an implied meaning here that I can''t quite discern.  Maybe having something to do with the bizarre life cycle of the cicada?  Anyway, I like this very much.</td>', 'Mysterious and tender.  There''s an implied meaning here that I can''t quite discern.  Maybe having something to do with the bizarre life cycle of the cicada?  Anyway, I like this very much.', '2014-05-23 12:46:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(7220110, 1112950, 173844, '<td valign="top">Not sure what I''m looking at, but it''s intriguing and creative, verging on collage.  I like to think that the mount on the right is a nippled volcano.  Good stuff.</td>', 'Not sure what I''m looking at, but it''s intriguing and creative, verging on collage.  I like to think that the mount on the right is a nippled volcano.  Good stuff.', '2014-05-23 15:27:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(7220114, 1112673, 173844, '<td valign="top">OK, a wing is a wing.  This seemingly simple photo is actually quite astounding.  The slightly unusual architecture is broken into myriad planes, with their tones varying in accordance to their access to sunlight.  Then there are the ladders, railings and rooftops.  It''s a realistic mash-up of cubism and Escher.  Nice touches include the tank, the tree and the cloud streak.  The creamy sepia is lovely.  Going into my favorites.</td>', 'OK, a wing is a wing.  This seemingly simple photo is actually quite astounding.  The slightly unusual architecture is broken into myriad planes, with their tones varying in accordance to their access to sunlight.  Then there are the ladders, railings and rooftops.  It''s a realistic mash-up of cubism and Escher.  Nice touches include the tank, the tree and the cloud streak.  The creamy sepia is lovely.  Going into my favorites.', '2014-05-23 15:43:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(7220121, 1112673, 67258, '<td valign="top">Definitely oob!  The processing gives this a very eerie feeling, almost post-apocalyptic.</td>', 'Definitely oob!  The processing gives this a very eerie feeling, almost post-apocalyptic.', '2014-05-23 15:55:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(7220122, 1113066, 67258, '<td valign="top">Ha! I was rather confused by the flying pepper until I read the title and all became clear...</td>', 'Ha! I was rather confused by the flying pepper until I read the title and all became clear...', '2014-05-23 15:56:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(7220126, 1113058, 67258, '<td valign="top">Somewhat over-exposed and lacking in the fine textural detail that is needed to really make macro shots such as this work.  Watch out for your background - the sharply cut leaf with the pink thing behind spoiled the aesthetics of the photo.</td>', 'Somewhat over-exposed and lacking in the fine textural detail that is needed to really make macro shots such as this work.  Watch out for your background - the sharply cut leaf with the pink thing behind spoiled the aesthetics of the photo.', '2014-05-23 16:00:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(7220129, 1112903, 67258, '<td valign="top">Lovely bokeh, and an excellent pose from your winged model, colours are good, and there is some textural detail, but tbh I would love to see more detail, especially in the fascinating head and eyes.  There does seem to be a degree of coarseness to the image, and I wonder if that is perhaps down to post-processing style rather than the base image.</td>', 'Lovely bokeh, and an excellent pose from your winged model, colours are good, and there is some textural detail, but tbh I would love to see more detail, especially in the fascinating head and eyes.  There does seem to be a degree of coarseness to the image, and I wonder if that is perhaps down to post-processing style rather than the base image.', '2014-05-23 16:04:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(7220130, 1112498, 67258, '<td valign="top">Chocks away, Biggles!</td>', 'Chocks away, Biggles!', '2014-05-23 16:11:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(7220193, 1112980, 159196, '<td valign="top">made me laugh...</td>', 'made me laugh...', '2014-05-23 18:04:23.000000', NULL, 1),
